OL,3,GNEWSAM2 reopens after emergency works
OL,4,Aand days of disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M2 that was closed
OL,7,Fovernight for emergency repair works
OL,8,Fafter days of disruption has reopened
OL,9,Fon Friday.
OL,11,FSections of the motorway between
OL,12,FChatham and Sittingbourne had been
OL,13,Fclosed since Tuesday evening after an
OL,14,Fincident in which a pedestrian died.
OL,16,FThey were closed again on Thursday
OL,17,Fevening for what a National Highways
OL,18,Fspokesperson called "emergency
OL,19,Fresurfacing works".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
