OL,3,GNEWSAM2 reopens after emergency works
OL,4,Aand days of disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll lanes of the coastbound carriageway
OL,7,Freopened at 05:00 GMT following the
OL,8,Fovernight works, after the motorway
OL,9,Fclosed at 20:00 GMT on Thursday.
